# Helm Practice & Cluster Addons Guide (CKA)

This directory contains standalone Helm automation scripts designed for hands-on Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA) practice with package management, cluster monitoring, and metrics addons.

---

## 1. Directory Structure

```text
/home/vagrant/cka/helm/
├── README.md                      # This guide
├── install-deprecated-ingress-nginx.sh -> install-deprecated-nginx-ingress.sh # Convenience alias symlink
├── install-deprecated-nginx-ingress.sh # Final release of deprecated Ingress-NGINX (v4.15.1)
├── install-httpbin-go.sh          # Lightweight httpbin-go installer (mccutchen/go-httpbin)
├── install-httpbingo.sh -> install-httpbin-go.sh # Convenience alias symlink
├── install-kube-metrics.sh        # Metrics Server Helm installer (--kubelet-insecure-tls)
├── install-kube-prometheus.sh     # Lightweight Prometheus Operator installer (Prometheus only)
├── install-nfs-csi-driver.sh      # Kubernetes NFS CSI Driver installer for dynamic PVs
├── install-csi-driver-nfs.sh -> install-nfs-csi-driver.sh # Convenience alias symlink
└── install-nginx-gateway-fabric.sh # NGINX Gateway Fabric installer (Gateway API)
```

---

## 2. Overview of Addon Scripts

| Script | Helm Chart | Target Namespace | Description & Footprint |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `install-httpbin-go.sh` | `estahn/httpbingo` | `default` | Deploys Go-based `httpbin` service with minimal footprint (10m CPU / 16Mi RAM). Ideal test backend for Ingress, Gateway API, and NetworkPolicy drills. |
| `install-kube-metrics.sh` | `metrics-server/metrics-server` | `kube-system` | Enables `kubectl top nodes` and `kubectl top pods`. Configured with `--kubelet-insecure-tls` for homelab kubelet scraping. |
| `install-kube-prometheus.sh` | `prometheus-community/kube-prometheus-stack` | `monitoring` | Deploys Prometheus Operator and a single-replica Prometheus instance. Grafana, Alertmanager, node-exporter, and kube-state-metrics are disabled for a minimal footprint on lab VMs. |
| `install-nginx-gateway-fabric.sh` | `oci://ghcr.io/nginx/charts/nginx-gateway-fabric` | `nginx-gateway` | Deploys NGINX Gateway Fabric and standard Kubernetes Gateway API CRDs (`gatewayclasses`, `gateways`, `httproutes`). Configured with `NodePort` service type for lab VM accessibility. |
| `install-deprecated-nginx-ingress.sh` | `ingress-nginx/ingress-nginx` | `ingress-nginx` | Deploys final release (`4.15.1`) of the retired community Ingress-NGINX controller. Configured with `NodePort` (`30080`/`30443`) and `ingressClassName: nginx` for classic CKA Ingress drills. |
| `install-nfs-csi-driver.sh` | `csi-driver-nfs/csi-driver-nfs` | `kube-system` | Deploys the Kubernetes SIG Storage NFS CSI Driver (controller + node daemonset) for automated dynamic PersistentVolume creation backed by `nfs-server.local:{{ cka_lab_nfs_export_dir }}`. |

