## 3. Usage Instructions

### Script 1: Install Kubernetes Metrics Server

Run the installer:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-kube-metrics.sh
```

#### Verification

Wait 60–90 seconds for initial metric gathering, then run:

```bash
# Verify Metrics Server deployment
kubectl get deployment metrics-server -n kube-system

# Verify node metrics collection
kubectl top nodes

# Verify pod metrics collection across all namespaces
kubectl top pods -A
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall metrics-server -n kube-system
```

---

### Script 2: Install Minimal Prometheus Operator

Run the installer:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-kube-prometheus.sh
```

#### Verification

```bash
# Verify Prometheus operator and instance pods
kubectl get pods -n monitoring

# Verify Prometheus custom resource
kubectl get prometheus -n monitoring

# Verify registered ServiceMonitors
kubectl get servicemonitors -A
```

#### Accessing Prometheus Web UI

Forward the Prometheus server port to localhost:

```bash
kubectl port-forward -n monitoring svc/kube-prometheus-kube-prome-prometheus 9090:9090
```

From another terminal or via curl:

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:9090/-/ready
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall kube-prometheus -n monitoring
kubectl delete namespace monitoring
```

---

### Script 3: Install NGINX Gateway Fabric

Run the installer:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-nginx-gateway-fabric.sh
```

#### Verification

```bash
# Verify Gateway API CRDs
kubectl get crds | grep -i gateway

# Verify GatewayClass registered by controller
kubectl get gatewayclasses

# Verify NGINX Gateway Fabric deployment and service (NodePorts 30080/30443)
kubectl get pods,svc -n nginx-gateway

# Test connectivity from control plane or workstation on host/NodePort 30080
curl -I http://192.168.56.20:30080/
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall ngf -n nginx-gateway
kubectl delete namespace nginx-gateway
```

### Script 4: Install httpbin-go (Test Target Backend)

Run the installer:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-httpbin-go.sh
```

*(Note: `install-httpbingo.sh` is provided as a convenience symlink).*

#### Verification

```bash
# Verify httpbin-go deployment rollout
kubectl rollout status deployment httpbingo -n default

# Inspect pods and services
kubectl get pods,svc -l app.kubernetes.io/instance=httpbingo

# Query /get endpoint via ephemeral curl pod
kubectl run test-curl --rm -i --restart=Never --image=curlimages/curl:latest -- http://httpbingo.default.svc.cluster.local/get
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall httpbingo -n default
```

