### Script 5: Install Deprecated Ingress-NGINX Controller

Deploy the final release (`4.15.1`) of the retired community Ingress-NGINX Controller:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-deprecated-nginx-ingress.sh
```

*(Note: `install-deprecated-ingress-nginx.sh` is provided as a convenience symlink).*

#### Verification

```bash
# Verify Ingress controller deployment rollout
kubectl rollout status deployment -n ingress-nginx -l app.kubernetes.io/name=ingress-nginx

# Inspect controller pods and NodePort service
kubectl get pods,svc -n ingress-nginx

# Verify registered IngressClasses
kubectl get ingressclasses

# Test classic Ingress routing (drills under ~/cka/networking/)
/home/vagrant/cka/networking/test-ingress.sh
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall ingress-nginx -n ingress-nginx
kubectl delete namespace ingress-nginx
```

