### Script 6: Install Kubernetes NFS CSI Driver

Deploy the Kubernetes SIG Storage NFS CSI Driver to enable automated dynamic PV provisioning:

```bash
cd /home/vagrant/cka/helm
./install-nfs-csi-driver.sh
```

*(Note: `install-csi-driver-nfs.sh` is provided as a convenience symlink).*

#### Verification

```bash
# Verify NFS CSI controller rollout
kubectl rollout status deployment -n kube-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=csi-driver-nfs

# Verify NFS CSI node plugin daemonset
kubectl rollout status daemonset -n kube-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=csi-driver-nfs

# Verify registered CSI drivers
kubectl get csidrivers

# Test dynamic PV provisioning (drills under ~/cka/storage-classes/)
/home/vagrant/cka/storage-classes/02-storage-classes/test-nfs-csi-drills.sh
```

#### Uninstallation

```bash
helm uninstall csi-driver-nfs -n kube-system
```

